        "@1": "Eightolives' Trains displays the schedules of many trains, subways, and buses. Real-time estimates (in blue) are provided when available. You can view schedule by stop, schedule by trip or schedules by bus route. A map view lets you track a trip or select a nearby stop. You can find itineraries for getting from point A to point B. Audio Mode can assist by talking you through all operations using 5 floating buttons.\n",
